+  // Elided with the braid SVG: the third-language copy table (the 0.1.1-era
+  // "better-locale override dicts" registration). It registers through the
+  // locale service's single-locale form — ctx.locale.register(NS, locale,
+  // dict) — for every language a language-pack plugin adds with
+  // ctx.locale.addLanguage, so the braid renders in that language too. The
+  // private `betterLocale` override store the 0.1.1-era code probed was never
+  // a harness service, and better-locale removed it in its own
+  // 0.1.2-alpha.1 adaptation; probing it now would leave the braid silently
+  // in zh/en. Registering once at apply is enough: duplicate (ns, locale)
+  // throws, and dictionaries may arrive before their language definition.
+  // The type-level namespace declaration lives in client.d.ts.
 }
